 - The UI was written for 2.4 GHz chips. The hostname is limited to 7 characters (`devname[8]`). The Device page enforces that (`maxlength`, counter) and shows a read-only preview of the DHCP host name; the preview repeats the rules of `sys_dhcp_hostname()`, so change both together.
